  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fostering Advancement of Inclusive and Rights-Based Justice (FAIR)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FAIR aims to support the Philippines enhance administration of justice for socially disadvantaged groups such as women, children, people with disability. This investment focuses on improving the quality of judicial process, including adjudication and case management concerning socially disadvantaged groups, strengthening transparency and accountability, as well as improving inclusion and accessibility in the delivery of justice.</narrative>
  </description>
